Output demos/settings.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 780
Set Height 420
Set FontSize 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set CursorBlink false
Set TypingSpeed 20ms

Hide
Type "./target/debug/examples/demo settings"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Sleep 800ms
Right
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 800ms
Right
Sleep 800ms
Up
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Escape
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
